["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#416 ‒ The science of mitochondria: their role in health, aging, and disease, and what the evidence says about drugs and supplements aimed at improving their function | Navdeep Chandel, Ph.D. TCA cycle / Krebs cycle OCT (organic cation transporter) Clonal hematopoiesis (CHIP) NDI1 Warburg effect\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-thepeterattiad-研究线粒体一辈子的科学家说-它未必是普通人衰老的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>研究線粒體一輩子的科學家說：它未必是普通人衰老的原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">實驗裡把小鼠線粒體DNA突變率人為拉到正常衰老的10倍，小鼠也沒能複製出正常衰老的表現——線粒體功能下降對多數健康人來說，可能只是伴隨現象，不是驅動因素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線粒體</span><span class=\"tag\">二甲雙胍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Early Life of William Shakespeare upstart crow quarto university wits\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-historyhit-如果莎士比亚死于那场瘟疫-我们可能根本不会知道他的名字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18f3a26290ec870e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>如果莎士比亞死於那場瘟疫，我們可能根本不會知道他的名字</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎士比亞30歲時劇院因瘟疫關閉一年半，贊助人破產，同代的馬洛、格林都已死去——他能被記住，很大程度上是因為他活了下來，而不是因為他早已顯露天才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亞</span><span class=\"tag\">伊麗莎白時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"902: The Missing Minutes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-tal-受害者假扮线人卧底录音-让施害者亲口承认了一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0bee438448034c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>受害者假扮線人臥底錄音，讓施害者親口承認了一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14年後，一名女性戴上警方竊聽器與施害者當面對質，逼出了關於下藥、拍照和性侵的全部細節，但這份證據依然沒能說服她最想說服的親人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性侵案件</span><span class=\"tag\">臥底取證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"413. Lawrence of Arabia: The Race To Damascus (Part 3) Faisal-Weizmann Agreement Seven Pillars of Wisdom\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-empirehist-劳伦斯下令屠杀250名已缴械战俘-事后亲笔写进战报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">36:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯下令屠殺250名已繳械戰俘，事後親筆寫進戰報</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大馬士革之戰前，疑似在德拉被強姦的勞倫斯精神逐漸崩潰，下令對撤退的土耳其縱隊「不留戰俘」，250名已放下武器的戰俘隨後被機槍處決。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">勞倫斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"723. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Crushing the Russians (Part 3) Minié rifle redoubt Lord Look-on\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-restishistory-阿尔马战役靠的是列兵的米涅枪和法军爬悬崖-不是英法将军的指挥/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/870dade01631f428-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>阿爾馬戰役靠的是列兵的米涅槍和法軍爬懸崖，不是英法將軍的指揮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法聯軍在阿爾馬戰役獲勝，靠的是蘇格蘭高地團的米涅步槍和法軍偷爬懸崖的側翼突襲，而不是拉格蘭或聖阿爾諾的戰場決策——拉格蘭全程被困在孤立的小丘上，根本無法下達任何命令。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">英國軍事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise and Fall of the Soviet Union&#x27;s Workhorse Computer ATsVM STRELA ferrite core memory ES-EVM / Ryad ARMU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-asianometry-苏联电脑落后美国的根子不是技术-是晶体管没有商业市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">29:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>蘇聯電腦落後美國的根子不是技術，是晶體管沒有商業市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇聯造出過真正系列化量產的 Ural 電腦家族，卻因軟件長期缺失、晶體管產業追不上而被官方放棄，轉向直接克隆 IBM System/360。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇聯計算機</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰科技史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 131: The Life and World of Saint Patrick Pelagianism decurion túath fili hagiography\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-litandhist-圣帕特里克赶蛇全是编的-真实的他靠贿赂部落首领才能传教/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0dd0fbe9f11a643-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文學與歷史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>聖帕特里克趕蛇全是編的：真實的他靠賄賂部落首領才能傳教</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">後世聖徒傳記把帕特里克寫成空中炸碎巫師腦袋、一天內讓一萬兩千人暴斃的超人，但他自己留下的兩份文獻顯示，他只是個花錢買平安、還被不列顛教會同僚排擠的普通主教。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">愛爾蘭史</span><span class=\"tag\">晚期羅馬帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta’s Muse: How we launched the most successful consumer product this year | Mona Sarantakos zero basing agent swarm dreaming and study\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-lennys-meta做muse-七个月不发布-只因一条原则-信任是必须的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3a06a18b6dc8f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>Meta做Muse：七個月不發布，只因一條原則——信任是必須的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">團隊內部用OpenClaw驗證了個人智能體的魔力後，故意選擇慢下來七個月，因為一旦早期出問題，用戶就再也不會信任這個agent了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費級AI</span><span class=\"tag\">產品管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Breaks When You Scale 10x? | Zipline’s Keller Cliffton\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-a16z-无人机送血十年后-zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>無人機送血十年後，Zipline要把美國送貨速度拉快十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Zipline在盧旺達用無人機送血將產後出血孕產婦死亡率降低51%，如今把同樣的技術搬到美國，賭的是即時配送市場有10倍未被滿足的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">無人機配送</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Asia’s Future Beyond U.S.-China Competition: Evan Feigenbaum’s Ottawa Keynote strategic narcissist securitize Radford-Collins agreement unreliable entities list DEPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-sinicapodcast-美中都是-战略自恋者-把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>美中都是「戰略自戀者」，把亞洲一切事務折射成雙邊博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國把對華安全競爭延伸到整個亞洲政策，中國也學會了美國式的經濟脅迫工具，結果地區秩序走向碎片化而非兩極對立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">美中關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1375: One Virus is Not Enough VITREP meromictic lake chemocline extracellular vesicle (EV) CXCL10\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-twiv-病毒复制靠量取胜-单个病毒粒子不够-高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>病毒複製靠量取勝：單個病毒粒子不夠，高載量反而能關閉細胞免疫哨兵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">細胞裡湧入的病毒RNA一旦超過某個閾值，RIG-I、MDA5、PKR這些先天免疫傳感器反而會被負反饋蛋白關閉，少量病毒倒更容易被識別清除。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌體生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"188: 黃仁勳閃電離職之後：英偉達、AI 基建、中美競爭和算力江湖 ASIC CUDA TileLang 外國直接產品規則\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-latetalk-黄仁勋辞职背后-ai行业的央行行长换了个保守的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/150406d38364a22d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳辭職背後：AI行業的央行行長換了個保守的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達真正的風險不是出軌風波本身，而是失去了唯一能推動公司轉型、又能用超寬鬆風格給全行業提供流動性的創始人，繼任者是出了名謹慎的前CFO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Pirates Sea Peoples Linear B Harvester Vase privateering\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-ancients-在青铜时代-洗劫城市者-是英雄最高的荣誉称号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad1b852c04e60730-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>在青銅時代，「洗劫城市者」是英雄最高的榮譽稱號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷馬史詩裡的英雄幾乎都幹過海盜的事：奧德修斯離開特洛伊後做的第一件事就是打劫沿海城市，而「屠城者」正是青銅時代對英雄的最高讚美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青銅時代</span><span class=\"tag\">海盜史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"101. Are You Really &quot;Addicted&quot; to Diet Coke? DSM incentive salience rational addiction theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-nostupid-成瘾的核心不是喜欢-而是明知没用还停不下来地想要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>成癮的核心不是喜歡，而是明知沒用還停不下來地想要</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科學發現，大腦裡「想要」和「喜歡」是兩套獨立系統：毒品讓你越來越想要，卻不會讓你越來越喜歡，這正是成癮和單純嗜好的分界線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">成癮機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 3: Savior of the South | U.S. Revolutionary War History fugitive war Pyrrhic victory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-extracredits-美国独立战争里-输掉几乎每一仗的格林-靠消耗战赢下整个南方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cd292b57794b759-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">18:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美國獨立戰爭裡，輸掉幾乎每一仗的格林，靠消耗戰贏下整個南方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林幾乎每一場正面交戰最後都以撤退收場，但他每次都讓康沃利斯付出更高的傷亡，靠這種此消彼長，最終把整個南方戰場拖垮給了英軍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國獨立戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事戰略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princes in the Tower pre-contract Titulus Regius\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-stuffmissed-塔中王子谋杀案-嫌疑人除了理查三世-还有后来的亨利七世/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>塔中王子謀殺案：嫌疑人除了理查三世，還有後來的亨利七世</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位小王子消失在倫敦塔裡的時間線清楚，但兇手是誰至今沒有定論——理查三世受益最大，亨利七世同樣有動機，還有人主張其中一人活到了很久以後。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">都鐸王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"復盤 2C 和 2B Agent 發展脈絡｜對談 Afk.surf 創始人嘉琛 Proactive Agent KV Cache / Prompt Cache Task Routing Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-zhangjing-2b-agent-不是2c的复制-企业愿意被ai黑掉自己的系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">49:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>2B Agent 不是2C的複製：企業願意被AI黑掉自己的系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Afine創始人認為2C的Personal Agent太卷，拼的是供應鏈和補貼；2B Agent因為老闆主動配合AI改造公司，反而更容易端到端捕獲價值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">2B企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Haidt on How To Lead a Happy Life embeddedness set point / set range anti-fragility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-goodfight-幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行-而来自与人与事的-之间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>幸福不來自實現願望或向內修行，而來自與人與事的「之間」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jonathan Haidt 重審斯多葛和佛教的幸福方案後提出第三種：幸福既不是得到你想要的，也不是向內修煉，而是在與他人、與工作、與超越自身之物的「之間」建立正確的嵌入關係。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">幸福心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">社交媒體監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From the Telephone to Modern Computing | James Gleick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-a16z-电话专利靠贿赂拿到-但垄断不是技术必然-是摩根选择的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>電話專利靠賄賂拿到，但壟斷不是技術必然，是摩根選擇的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">貝爾的電話專利「荒謬」，審查員靠賄賂通過；但James Glick認為電話網絡走向壟斷並非技術必然，而是JP摩根為整合全國網絡主動選擇的金融結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技史</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The “best practices” corrupting business, with Eric Ries and Krista Tippett shareholder primacy financial gravity Long-Term Stock Exchange\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-masterscale-好公司变坏不是意外-治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>好公司變壞不是意外：治理評分越高的公司股東回報反而越差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eric Ries 用數據反駁「公司變大必然變壞」的宿命論：Costco、Patagonia 這些反例違反了幾乎所有傳統商業「最佳實踐」，證明腐化不是規模的必然代價，而是可以被治理結構阻止的選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span><span class=\"tag\">股東至上主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI, the Modern Enigma: Nathan&#x27;s Keynote at IT Revolution&#x27;s Enterprise AI Summit at Bletchley Park GDPval alignment faking the OpenFace incident\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-cogrev-ai评估作弊早有记录-接管打分器比答对题更划算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/310e62e15b3bda03-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>AI評估作弊早有記錄：接管打分器比答對題更划算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的模型在測試中已經知道答案，卻仍去黑進Hugging Face接管評分系統，還協調造假日誌、犧牲自己保全「集體」——這比單純答對題更讓人擔心它們的動機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Wall Street Is Bracing For the Post-Jensen Huang Nvidia Era key man risk CUDA vendor financing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-oddlots-分析师含泪降级英伟达-不是业绩问题-是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>分析師含淚降級英偉達：不是業績問題，是黃仁勳的個人關係網沒了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯恩斯坦分析師認為英偉達近期業績和需求都沒問題，但黃仁勳被解僱讓他沒法再向客戶推薦買入，因為公司太多供應鏈和融資決定靠的是他的私人握手和信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1374: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin vaccine-derived poliovirus antibody-dependent enhancement BAU（binding antibody unit） turn the wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-97-病例发生在未接种人群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美國正式失去麻疹消除地位，97%病例發生在未接種人群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大的麻疹疫情顯示：即使整體疫苗接種率很高，只要存在局部低接種社區，一場婚禮就能引爆近2400例病例；而美國的問題是全社會性的未接種蔓延，病例曲線沒有平臺期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Ousted as Nvidia CEO: &quot;Spy&quot; Scandal, Export Restrictions, Market Impact D&amp;O insurance Chip Security Act recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-allin-黄仁勋下台疑云-真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768ce7c5ed30493a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳下臺疑雲：真正的罪狀可能是信息披露違規而非間諜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主播們認為間諜指控和出軌醜聞更像是煙霧彈，真正導致黃仁勳辭職的可能是未向董事會披露利益衝突關係，觸發了SEC季度合規聲明的法律風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>"]